         {
          "title": "What it is for",
          "body_md": "Whenever we move about — walking, coming and going — we might hurt tiny living beings without noticing. **Iriyavahiyam** (ઇરિયાવહિયં) is how we say sorry for that before we begin Samayik. Right after it come **Tassa Uttari** and **Annattha** — you will meet them in the next two levels.",
