          "body_md": "For extra cleansing (*uttari karan*), for atonement (*prayashchitt*), for purity (*vishodhi*) and to pull out inner thorns (*vishalli*) — so that our *paap* (harmful karma) can be destroyed. Then: *“thami kaussaggam”* — I now stay still in kayotsarg.",
